Package: golemworldbank
Title: World Bank Indicators Explorer
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("Dimitrios", "Zacharatos", email = "dzacharatos@yahoo.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Dimitrios Zacharatos [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Dimitrios Zacharatos <dzacharatos@yahoo.com>
Description: A Shiny application, built as a golem package, for exploring
    World Bank development indicators through interactive country
    comparison, indicator comparison, population pyramid, ranked bar chart,
    correlation scatter, and choropleth map views.
